        "created_at": "2015-12-04T19:09:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>\n[quote=\"morph147\"]\n<span>&nbsp;so has a boat left China?&nbsp;</span></p><p>\n[/quote]\n</p><p>\n[quote=\"Paul\"]\n</p><p>Yes!</p><p>\n[/quote]\n</p><p>Well you're not Christopher but some of his trickiness could have rubbed off on you because I'm certain <strong>A</strong> boat has left China too.</p><p>Has a boat containing Villains of the Multiverse (of which there is at least one copy scheduled to reach me)&nbsp;left China? would be a more loophole closing question.</p>",
