        "created_at": "2015-12-16T22:45:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It'll be awesome to put away my jumbled mess of written on and crossed out playtesting cards and replace them with legible cards that aren't cheap cardstock and have pictures on them.</p><p>Villains makes the Vengeance format really shine, and it has taken over our 3-player games most of the time, it's just a much better game when you have 3 players.</p><p>Also the Environments rule.</p>",
