        "created_at": "2015-12-19T00:45:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I always tested with 1 or 2 of the Vengeance Villains so I could compare difficulty and see how they interact, and I think they do fine, although on Advanced things can get a bit crazy. &nbsp;Some combos can get really nasty together, and some of the Nemesis interactions were really cool between decks.</p><p>One of my favorite teams to face is the ladies of Villainry: &nbsp;Ermine, Friction, Miss Information, La Capitan and The Operative. &nbsp;It's a fun fight.</p>",
